        "slc_c4425d78928661688beffdea8bd6fc02ed4c97346ba5ec36ac7551332ffb68f5"
      ],
      "text": "AliFullStack is an Electron desktop app with a sandboxed renderer process for the React UI and a privileged Node.js main process, communicating via IPC."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_abd49e09e6341098acb9293f5aa4af67e54811ca7eb79a95dc4e2e80e7614579",
