        "slc_59ccedbf094228d733aafa8d1c48eeb020f904aab5abc0bfdaaa19063f193baa"
      ],
      "text": "The project deliberately simulates tool calling with XML-like tags instead of native function calling, citing support for many simultaneous calls and evidence that JSON-embedded code degrades quality."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
