        "slc_ebef83b1245cf6b095462ef0ce734dbdfd3e059980ab06544a632fb06d6be521"
      ],
      "text": "The agentic loop is intentionally simple: typically a single LLM request per user prompt, with optional TypeScript auto-fix, avoiding complex multi-step agent workflows to control cost."
    },
